{"id":"vod_bf_50291","vodId":"50291","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"不死女轮堂鸦夜","name_cn":"不死女轮堂鸦夜","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230706-1/f649544f9249ef51eb49cacb59a74ab5.jpg"},"summary":"不死之身的吸血鬼为何遭到杀害？ 　　「鸟笼使者」──那就是专查怪物案件的侦探。 　　吸血鬼及人造人、怪盗、狼人、开膛手，还有名侦探。异形蠢动的十九世纪末欧洲，人类亲和派的吸血鬼遭到银桩贯穿虐杀死亡。找来解决此案的，是专门处理人类避之唯恐不及的「怪物案件」的专门侦探轮堂鸦夜，以及带着奇怪鸟笼的男人真打津轻。他们从留存的线索和怪物才具备的特性导出推理。充满谜团宛如噩梦的笑剧，在此开幕！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:08:43","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/businvluntangyaye/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:58:02.612Z"}